  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3249.02 Mobile Service Garage Inspection Station Authorization",
  "priorExpiration": "2024-02-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3249.02 Mobile Service Garage Inspection Station Authorization. The director shall authorize as an inspection station a mobile service garage that is contracted with employers, provided:\n\n(a) Inspections shall only be performed while the mobile service garage is on an employer’s premises;\n\n(b) Inspections shall be performed solely on vehicles registered to employees of the contracted employer or registered to the employer; and\n\n(c) Each inspection station shall conspicuously post on the outside of its vehicle or trailer:\n\n(1) In a form and size approved by the director, that it is an authorized inspection station; and\n\n(2) A sign showing the inspection fee charged and the additional fee charged for the OBD II testing under RSA 266:59-b, provided that no authorized inspection station shall include the cost of the OBD II testing and reporting in the inspection fee charged for a vehicle not subject to the OBD II requirements.\n\nSource. #13727, INTERIM, eff 8-19-23, EXPIRES: 2-15-24; ss by #13920, eff 4-5-24\n\nAPPENDIX A – STATUTES IMPLEMENTED\n\nAPPENDIX B – INCORPORATED REFERENCES\n\nRule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nSaf-C 3202.17 Saf-C 3202.17 Saf-C 3222.02(b) Saf-C 3236.03(b) | “Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE) J1978, E/E Diagnostic Test Modes—Equivalent to ISO/DIS 15031-5,” effective 04/30/02 “Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE) J1979, E/E Diagnostic Test Modes,” effective 05/30/07 “Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE) J2012, Diagnostic Trouble Code Definitions,” effective 12/10/07 “Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE) J2825, Measurement of Exhaust Sound Pressure Levels of Stationary On-Highway Motorcycles,” effective 11/19/12 | SAE World Headquarters 400 Commonwealth Drive Warrendale, PA 15096-0001 Telephone Orders: (877) 606-7323 FAX: (724) 776-0790 Web Site: www.sae.org Cost: $72.00 per publication by mail or FAX for non-members; can also be downloaded at same price; members save up to 19% off list price",
